<div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
  <h1>Account & Data Deletion Request</h1>
  <p>
    <strong>Developer:</strong> BanjaraMatch (as shown on Google Play Store)
  </p>
  <h2>How to Request Account Deletion</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Email us at <a href="mailto:support@banjaramatch.com">support@banjaramatch.com</a> from the email address associated with your account.</li>
    <li>Include your full name and any relevant account details to help us identify your account.</li>
    <li>We will process your request within 7 business days and confirm via email once your account and associated data have been deleted.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>What Data is Deleted</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>All personal information (name, email, profile details)</li>
    <li>Uploaded photos and profile images</li>
    <li>Chat history and messages</li>
    <li>Account activity and preferences</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>What Data is Retained</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Some data may be retained for legal, security, or fraud prevention purposes as required by law. This data will be securely stored and deleted after the mandatory retention period.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Additional Information</h2>
  <p>
    For more details, please refer to our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/terms-conditions">Terms & Conditions</a>.
  </p>
</div>

